            For long runs and double days, use a carbohydrate-plus-protein mix such as Tailwind Recovery Mix or build one from whey isolate, fruit and oats. For everyday protein, choose an easy-digesting, NSF Certified for Sport powder such as Klean Isolate, Thorne or Vega Sport, and check the registry for the exact flavor if you race in tested events.
